Test::API::Docker::Mock replaces _request wholesale, so _read_response, _read_chunked, the >=400 croak path, header sanitising and request-line assembly are exercised by nothing beyond use_ok in t/basic.t. The chunked reader in particular is hand-written and unverified. Way in: an in-memory filehandle over a canned HTTP/1.1 response passed to _read_response, no socket needed.
